Package: shinymcp
Title: Serve 'shiny' Apps as MCP Apps in AI Chat Clients
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("James", "Wade", , "github@jameshwade.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Serves 'shiny' apps as MCP Apps, the Model Context Protocol
    extension that lets AI chat clients show interactive pages in the
    conversation. An existing app runs as it is, its server function live in
    R, or an app can be built from tools the model can also call on their
    own. Includes an MCP server over standard input and output or HTTP, an
    endpoint for deploying apps to Posit Connect, a preview in the browser,
    and hosts for showing MCP Apps in 'shiny' and 'shinychat'.
Depends: R (>= 4.3.0)
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/JamesHWade/shinymcp, https://jameshwade.github.io/shinymcp/
